{"3784600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In a Bleak Midwinter", "steam_appid": 3784600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PUSH YOUR LIMITS, PUSH BEYOND ENEMY LINES AND EARN YOUR GLORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras/270693ec0807df57f04677faa1dae1e5.avif?t=1786672235\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras_big/270693ec0807df57f04677faa1dae1e5.webp?t=1786672235 width=1560 height=813 /></span>Bleak is a grounded tactical shooter where caution is everything. You will navigate alone or with your comrades in the frontlines and survive the horrors of war in places scarred by past or ongoing battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GROUNDED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grounded gameplay forces you to take caution and tactical decisions, check every corner, and do what is needed to claim your glory under the horrors of war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DYNAMIC BATTLEFIELDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras/2fc9757c7b07bf4aa44a210bcba673ee.avif?t=1786672235\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras_big/2fc9757c7b07bf4aa44a210bcba673ee.webp?t=1786672235 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras/394f8e3a9943663e38395bacc92d1fec.avif?t=1786672235\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras_big/394f8e3a9943663e38395bacc92d1fec.webp?t=1786672235 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, high-lethality close combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense fog and bleak atmospheric cinematic environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive enemy AI soldiers &amp; true horrors of war</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trench warfare and urban warfare, beyond enemy frontlines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urban/trench combat zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller friendly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PUSH YOUR LIMITS, PUSH BEYOND ENEMY LINES AND EARN YOUR GLORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras/270693ec0807df57f04677faa1dae1e5.avif?t=1786672235\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras_big/270693ec0807df57f04677faa1dae1e5.webp?t=1786672235 width=1560 height=813 /></span>Bleak is a grounded tactical shooter where caution is everything. You will navigate alone or with your comrades in the frontlines and survive the horrors of war in places scarred by past or ongoing battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GROUNDED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grounded gameplay forces you to take caution and tactical decisions, check every corner, and do what is needed to claim your glory under the horrors of war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DYNAMIC BATTLEFIELDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras/2fc9757c7b07bf4aa44a210bcba673ee.avif?t=1786672235\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras_big/2fc9757c7b07bf4aa44a210bcba673ee.webp?t=1786672235 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras/394f8e3a9943663e38395bacc92d1fec.avif?t=1786672235\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/extras_big/394f8e3a9943663e38395bacc92d1fec.webp?t=1786672235 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, high-lethality close combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense fog and bleak atmospheric cinematic environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive enemy AI soldiers &amp; true horrors of war</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trench warfare and urban warfare, beyond enemy frontlines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urban/trench combat zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller friendly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "In a Bleak Midwinter is an immersive first and third person grounded tactical shooter experience set in a real world inspired conflict, where you will survive alone or with others in the frontlines and experience the horrors of war. Push your limits, your glory awaits!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784600/142842f7b0ff8a446a4a3fb2077dc71ce604a